[S02] So you just, you're just kind of desperate and it just, you know, life just keeps kicking you down.

99
00:08:05.279 --> 00:08:07.269
[S02] And then you, you just go insane and I get it.

100
00:08:07.439 --> 00:08:08.949
[S02] And I get why people go insane.

101
