[S02] And maybe I'm insane right now.

102
00:08:10.759 --> 00:08:12.509
[S02] Maybe you're listening to me rant and it's like, I'm insane.

103
00:08:12.519 --> 00:08:13.910
[S02] I just haven't realized that I'm insane.

104
00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.509
